              "value": "Spray Hot Wax"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "Darius sprays hot wax from his improvised wax sprayer in a 15-foot cone. All creatures in the area must attempt a DC 20 Reflex save. Scented candle homunculi in the area take no damage, instead healing 2d6 damage. After using the hot wax cannon, Darius can't use it again until he takes two Interact actions while adjacent to the cauldron of bubbling wax to reload the sprayer.\n\nCritical Success: \nSuccess: \nFailure: \nCritical Failure: "
